---
// One call to action per audience: speak / sponsor / volunteer.
---

<section class="section section-dark" aria-labelledby="get-involved-heading">
  <div class="wrap flex flex-col gap-10 md:gap-11">
    <div class="max-w-3xl flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="kicker kicker-on-dark">Get involved</span>
      <h2 id="get-involved-heading" class="h-section text-white">A user group is only as good as the people who show up. Three ways in.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Speak -->
      <div class="card-dark p-7 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary-soft" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3" /><path d="M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3M8 21h8" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="h-card text-white">Speak</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-on-dark flex-grow">Never spoken before? Do ten minutes. We will pair you with an experienced NPPUG speaker and help you shape it.</p>
        <a href="/speak" class="link-arrow text-primary-soft hover:text-white">
          Submit a talk
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Sponsor -->
      <div class="card-dark p-7 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-secondary-light" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 21s-7-4.5-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 5.5-7 10-7 10z" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="h-card text-white">Sponsor</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-on-dark flex-grow">The venue and the pizza are free because someone pays for them. Put your name in front of Norfolk's Microsoft people every month.</p>
        <a href="/sponsorship" class="link-arrow text-secondary-light hover:text-white">
          See the sponsor pack
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Volunteer -->
      <div class="card-dark p-7 md:p-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-accent-soft" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5" /><path d="M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0" /><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5" /><path d="M16 20a5 5 0 0 1 5.5-5" />
        </svg>
        <h3 class="h-card text-white">Volunteer</h3>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-on-dark flex-grow">Help on the door, take the photos, run the socials, or bring an idea for the summit. An hour a month is plenty.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="link-arrow text-accent-soft hover:text-white">
          Get in touch
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
